1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,005
The clamped gas gets hotter.

2
00:00:02,005 --> 00:00:10,312
On the right, part of the heat was spent pushing the piston and the atmosphere back, so less was left to raise the temperature.

3
00:00:10,312 --> 00:00:15,625
To get the same temperature rise at constant pressure, you must supply more heat.

4
00:00:15,625 --> 00:00:19,023
So C p is always bigger than C v.

